<speak>I've been carrying a note around in my diary and treating it as something that simply needed doing. That is how I used to work at the business: if I had written something down, it became a task to complete. I'm trying to be more careful about that now. Still, I should tell you what I had come prepared to say. Please buy 250 units of Atlas <sub alias="you ess dee">USD</sub> Corporate Bond 2031 using a limit order at 300 <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars per unit. The transaction amount is 75,000 in American dollars.</speak>